/*
 * ============================================================
 * Important:
 *
 * The existing compiler/runtime stack also has a separate limit
 * defined by STACK_MAX. That limit must be increased as well if
 * you actually want more than 256 locals to be simultaneously
 * live at runtime.
 *
 * For example, in vm.h:
 *
 *   #define STACK_MAX 65536
 *
 * This allows the VM stack to hold the larger number of locals.
 */
